    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230-a4-a5">

                <pb facs="0579" n="493" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg493"/>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Imperial and
                            Royal Austro-Hungarian Consulate</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi
                                rendition="#italic">At Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1872-12-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 13, 1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With deep regret I received your
                    excellency’s dispatch informing me of the demise of His late Majesty Kamehameha
                    V, at 20 minutes past 10 o’clock on the 11th instant. I shall not fail to inform
                    the imperial and royal Austro-Hungarian government of this sad event by the
                    first opportunity.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain your excellency’s most obedient, humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_WH2">E. HOFFMAN</persName>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Austro-Hungarian Consul.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. W. Hutchison</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Minister of Foreign Affairs.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
